# Waylaying Pirates: "When this creature enters, if you control an artifact, tap target artifact or creature an opponent controls and put a
# stun counter on it." Bot1 controls three Moxen. The target must be an artifact or creature an opponent controls: Bot2's Island (a land),
# Bot1's own Mox Jet and the Pirates itself are refused; Bot2's Ornithopter is chosen. It becomes tapped with a stun counter (CR 122.1d, 701.26a);
# Bot2's Mox Ruby is left alone. On turn 4 Bot2's untap step removes the counter instead of untapping the Ornithopter (CR 122.1d).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Waylaying Pirates
Island
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Island
Island x17

